ang, Kraska, Khattab, 2025). Use when the user asks to analyse all files, a whole repo, all docs, large PDFs, or to aggregate or multi-hop across scattered sources. Skip one file, one function, a single needle, or a one-page PDF conversion. Triggers: long context, context rot, large codebase, many files, all files, big document, multi-document, PDF, aggregate, summarize everything, codebase-wide, multi-hop, recursive, sub-agents, map-reduce.\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  author: massimodeluisa\n  version: \"1.2.0\"\n  paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.24601", "declared_name": "recursive-decomposition", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
